From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 16:21:14 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] DVDInputStreamNavigator: call the menu from the VOBU on
 screen

libdvdnav records a menu call's resume point at the block it read last.
The read runs ahead of the picture by the queues, so Resume skipped what
they held, and at a title end it replayed the end and fell back to the
menu.
